                                                "sense_id": "8c28abe8-ffc9-37f5-88a5-4eb7fccbd146",
                                                "text": "In contrast to cyberprotection, cyberresilience anticipates that a cyberattack will succeed. It has in place methods for rapid detection, cushioning the effects and quickly restoring systems to their pre-attack state. […] Any additional regulation should incentivize organizations to increase their focus on cyberresilience and recovery."
